==To Start==
Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Find Wheelie Pete's stolen Sasparilla Barrels in Sunstone Valley.
*Find Barrels of Sasparilla - /5
*Return to Wheelie Pete
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Can you believe it! A pack of Sandscale manguana made off with all my sasparilla. Why, if I still had a good knee I’d march right down there and...<br />Hey, I bet a young'n like you could <font color='#D9781A'>bring my Barrels of Sasparilla back</font>, eh?" -Wheelie Pete
#Find Barrels of Sasparilla - /5
#*[[Barrel of Sasparilla|Barrels of Sasparilla]] are located all around the [[Sandscale Territory]] in [[Sunstone Valley]]. Watch out for [[Manguana|Sandscales]]!
#Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Hey, look at that, you found my sasparilla!<br />Good on you, <Player Name>. Now how about doing me another favor?" -Wheelie Pete
